    <author>
      <name>S1mple</name>
    </author>
    <category term="后端" scheme="http://s1mple555.github.io/categories/%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%AF/"/>
    <category term="博客搭建" scheme="http://s1mple555.github.io/tags/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h1 id="从零开始：用-GitHub-Hexo-搭建你的免费个人网站"><a href="#从零开始：用-GitHub-Hexo-搭建你的免费个人网站" class="headerlink" title="从零开始：用 GitHub + Hexo 搭建你的免费个人网站"></a>从零开始：用 GitHub + Hexo 搭建你的免费个人网站</h1><h2 id="一、准备工作"><a href="#一、准备工作" class="headerlink" title="一、准备工作"></a>一、准备工作</h2><p>在开始之前，我们需要准备三样东西。</p><h3 id="1-1-注册-GitHub-账号"><a href="#1-1-注册-GitHub-账号" class="headerlink" title="1.1 注册 GitHub 账号"></a>1.1 注册 GitHub 账号</h3><p>访问 <a href="https://github.com/">github.com</a> 注册一个账号。用户名建议用英文，因为后续你的网站地址会是 <code>用户名.github.io</code>，这个名字就是你的门面。</p><h3 id="1-2-安装-Node-js"><a href="#1-2-安装-Node-js" class="headerlink" title="1.2 安装 Node.js"></a>1.2 安装 Node.js</h3><p>Hexo 是运行在 Node.js 上的，所以需要先安装 Node.js。</p><ol><li>访问 <a href="https://nodejs.org/">nodejs.org</a>，下载 <strong>LTS（长期支持版）</strong>；</li><li>一路”下一步”安装完成；</li><li>打开终端（Windows 按 <code>Win + R</code> 输入 <code>cmd</code>，或直接打开 PowerShell），输入：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node -v</span><br><span class="line">npm -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>能看到版本号（例如 <code>v20.x.x</code> 和 <code>10.x.x</code>）就说明安装成功。</p><h3 id="1-3-安装-Git"><a href="#1-3-安装-Git" class="headerlink" title="1.3 安装 Git"></a>1.3 安装 Git</h3><p>Git 用于把博客源码推送到 GitHub。</p><ol><li>访问 <a href="https://git-scm.com/">git-scm.com</a> 下载安装；</li><li>安装完成后验证：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="1-4-准备一个友好的目录"><a href="#1-4-准备一个友好的目录" class="headerlink" title="1.4 准备一个友好的目录"></a>1.4 准备一个友好的目录</h3><p>准备一个<strong>不含中文</strong>的目录来放博客项目，例如 <code>D:\blog</code> 或 <code>C:\blog</code>。避免中文路径能省掉很多莫名其妙的报错。</p><h2 id="二、认识-Hexo-与整体工作流"><a href="#二、认识-Hexo-与整体工作流" class="headerlink" title="二、认识 Hexo 与整体工作流"></a>二、认识 Hexo 与整体工作流</h2><h3 id="Hexo-是什么？"><a href="#Hexo-是什么？" class="headerlink" title="Hexo 是什么？"></a>Hexo 是什么？</h3><p>Hexo 是一个<strong>静态网站生成器</strong>：你用 Markdown 写文章，它负责把 Markdown 渲染成一个个 HTML 网页文件。这些文件不需要数据库、不需要后端，随便一个静态服务器都能托管，而 GitHub Pages 恰好提供了免费的静态托管。</p><p>简单来讲，就是把markdown文章渲染为HTML代码(hexo g)，之后push HTML 代码到Github仓库(hexo d)，通过Github Pages进行展示。</p><h3 id="整体工作流"><a href="#整体工作流" class="headerlink" title="整体工作流"></a>整体工作流</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">用 Markdown 写文章 → hexo generate 生成静态网页 → hexo deploy 推送到 GitHub → GitHub Pages 自动发布上线</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>写作 → 生成 → 部署 → 上线</strong>，每次更新博客都是这四个步骤。</p><h2 id="三、本地搭建-Hexo-博客"><a href="#三、本地搭建-Hexo-博客" class="headerlink" title="三、本地搭建 Hexo 博客"></a>三、本地搭建 Hexo 博客</h2><p>注意！<br>hexo命令都是在my_blog目录中运行的，也就是在能访问到_config.yml的目录。</p><h3 id="3-1-安装脚手架"><a href="#3-1-安装脚手架" class="headerlink" title="3.1 安装脚手架"></a>3.1 安装脚手架</h3><p>在终端中执行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装后验证：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-2-初始化项目"><a href="#3-2-初始化项目" class="headerlink" title="3.2 初始化项目"></a>3.2 初始化项目</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo init my-blog</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> my-blog</span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>第一条命令会创建一个名为 <code>my-blog</code> 的文件夹，并放入一套完整的博客模板。</p><h3 id="3-3-认识目录结构"><a href="#3-3-认识目录结构" class="headerlink" title="3.3 认识目录结构"></a>3.3 认识目录结构</h3><p>其中注意_config.yml的修改，注意public的作用，注意sources下是写博客的位置。<br>public，通过hexo generate生成静态代码，部署时上传的就是它。</p><table><thead><tr><th>文件&#x2F;目录</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>_config.yml</code></td><td>博客的”总配置文件”，站点名称、作者、主题都在这里改  (需要修改为个人的信息)</td></tr><tr><td><code>package.json</code></td><td>项目依赖清单，类似”购物单”</td></tr><tr><td><code>scaffolds/</code></td><td>新建文章时使用的模板</td></tr><tr><td><code>source/_posts/</code></td><td><strong>你的文章都放在这里</strong>，Markdown 文件</td></tr><tr><td><code>themes/</code></td><td>存放主题（网站的皮肤）</td></tr><tr><td><code>public/</code></td><td>生成的静态网页，部署时上传的就是它 （存放的是渲染之后的静态代码，也就是上传的博客的静态代码）</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="3-4-本地预览"><a href="#3-4-本地预览" class="headerlink" title="3.4 本地预览"></a>3.4 本地预览</h3><p>首先清理缓存：hexo clean<br>生成静态代码：hexo generate</p><p>在项目目录执行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>浏览器打开 <code>http://localhost:4000</code>，你就能看到默认的 Hexo 首页了。<br>按 <code>Ctrl + C</code> 可以停止预览。</p><h3 id="3-5-常用命令速查表"><a href="#3-5-常用命令速查表" class="headerlink" title="3.5 常用命令速查表"></a>3.5 常用命令速查表</h3><table><thead><tr><th>命令</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>hexo new &quot;文章标题&quot;</code></td><td>新建一篇文章</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo generate</code>（或 <code>hexo g</code>）</td><td>生成静态网页</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo server</code>（或 <code>hexo s</code>）</td><td>本地预览</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo deploy</code>（或 <code>hexo d</code>）</td><td>部署到 GitHub</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo clean</code></td><td>清空缓存，页面异常时常用</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="四、写第一篇文章"><a href="#四、写第一篇文章" class="headerlink" title="四、写第一篇文章"></a>四、写第一篇文章</h2><h3 id="4-1-Front-matter"><a href="#4-1-Front-matter" class="headerlink" title="4.1 Front-matter"></a>4.1 Front-matter</h3><p>每篇文章开头有一段用 <code>---</code> 包裹的元信息，叫 Front-matter：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br><span class="line">title: 我的第一篇文章</span><br><span class="line">date: 2026-08-05 10:00:00</span><br><span class="line">tags:</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 随笔</span><br><span class="line">categories:</span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">  - 生活</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">---</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这里是文章正文……</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>title</code>、<code>date</code>、<code>tags</code>、<code>categories</code> 是最常用的四个字段。</p><h3 id="4-2-Markdown-快速上手"><a href="#4-2-Markdown-快速上手" class="headerlink" title="4.2 Markdown 快速上手"></a>4.2 Markdown 快速上手</h3><p>只需要记住这几种语法，就够写 90% 的文章了：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section"># 一级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">## 二级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="strong">**加粗文字**</span>，<span class="emphasis">*斜体文字*</span>，<span class="code">`行内代码`</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">```js</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">console.log(&quot;代码块&quot;);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">```</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[<span class="string">链接文字</span>](<span class="link">https://example.com</span>)</span><br><span class="line">![<span class="string">图片说明</span>](<span class="link">图片地址</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 无序列表项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">1.</span> 有序列表项</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 引用一句话</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-3-动手写一篇"><a href="#4-3-动手写一篇" class="headerlink" title="4.3 动手写一篇"></a>4.3 动手写一篇</h3><p>使用下面这条命令，和直接在sources&#x2F;_post下创建新的md文件，效果是一样的。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new 我的第一篇文章</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Q：文章里的图片不显示？</strong><br>图片要放在 <code>source/images/</code> 下，然后引用 <code>/images/xxx.png</code>；或者使用图床。</p><p>随便放一张先：<br><img src="/images/imajpg.jpg" alt="随便放一张先"></p><h2 id="五、配置与美化（模板）"><a href="#五、配置与美化（模板）" class="headerlink" title="五、配置与美化（模板）"></a>五、配置与美化（模板）</h2><p>推荐hexo的模板网站：<a href="https://hexo.node.org.cn/themes/">https://hexo.node.org.cn/themes/</a></p><h3 id="5-1-站点配置-config-yml"><a href="#5-1-站点配置-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="5.1 站点配置 _config.yml"></a>5.1 站点配置 <code>_config.yml</code></h3><p>打开根目录的 <code>_config.yml</code>，重点改这几个：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 站点信息</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">我的博客</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">subtitle:</span> <span class="string">记录成长</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">author:</span> <span class="string">你的名字</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 网站地址，部署后改成 https://你的用户名.github.io</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">http://XXX.github.io</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>改完保存，刷新浏览器就能看到效果。<strong>注意：修改后最好 <code>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo s</code> 重启预览</strong>，避免缓存导致看不到变化。</p><p>(注意，这里hexo server命令只是本地预览，并没有推送至Github Pages)</p><h3 id="5-2-安装一个主题"><a href="#5-2-安装一个主题" class="headerlink" title="5.2 安装一个主题"></a>5.2 安装一个主题</h3><p>默认主题比较朴素，推荐 <a href="https://github.com/next-theme/hexo-theme-next">NexT</a>（简洁经典）或 <a href="https://github.com/jerryc127/hexo-theme-butterfly">Butterfly</a>（功能丰富、颜值高）。以 NexT 为例：</p><p>克隆一个主题模板到themes的目录下。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/next-theme/hexo-theme-next.git themes/next</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后在 <code>_config.yml</code> 中切换：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">next</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重启预览，网站就换皮肤了。</p><h3 id="5-3-常用配置"><a href="#5-3-常用配置" class="headerlink" title="5.3 常用配置"></a>5.3 常用配置</h3><p>在主题的 <code>themes/next/_config.yml</code>（不同主题路径略有不同）里可以配置：</p><ul><li><strong>菜单</strong>：首页、归档、标签、关于、联系方式的二维码等</li><li><strong>头像和社交链接</strong>：GitHub、邮箱等</li><li><strong>评论系统</strong>：推荐 <a href="https://giscus.app/">giscus</a>（基于 GitHub Discussions，免费、无需自建服务器）或 utterances</li><li><strong>访问统计</strong></li></ul><h2 id="六、部署到-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#六、部署到-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="六、部署到 GitHub Pages"></a>六、部署到 GitHub Pages</h2><h3 id="6-1-创建仓库"><a href="#6-1-创建仓库" class="headerlink" title="6.1 创建仓库"></a>6.1 创建仓库</h3><p>登录 GitHub，点击右上角 <code>+</code> → <strong>New repository</strong>：</p><ul><li>Repository name 填：<strong><code>你的用户名.github.io</code></strong>（例如 <code>zhangsan.github.io</code>）</li><li>选择 <strong>Public</strong></li><li>点击创建</li></ul><h3 id="6-2-方法-A：hexo-deployer-git（新手推荐）"><a href="#6-2-方法-A：hexo-deployer-git（新手推荐）" class="headerlink" title="6.2 方法 A：hexo-deployer-git（新手推荐）"></a>6.2 方法 A：hexo-deployer-git（新手推荐）</h3><ol><li>在项目里安装部署插件：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li>在 <code>_config.yml</code> 底部加上：</li></ol><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">main</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li>依次执行：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>第一次部署时 GitHub 会要求登录授权，按提示操作即可。之后每次更新文章，执行同样的三条命令就能上线。</p><h3 id="6-3-方法-B：GitHub-Actions-自动部署（进阶推荐）"><a href="#6-3-方法-B：GitHub-Actions-自动部署（进阶推荐）" class="headerlink" title="6.3 方法 B：GitHub Actions 自动部署（进阶推荐）"></a>6.3 方法 B：GitHub Actions 自动部署（进阶推荐）</h3><p>手动部署的缺点是每次都要在本地执行命令。用 GitHub Actions 可以实现”代码一推送，自动构建上线”。</p><p>先在仓库的 <strong>Settings → Pages</strong> 里把 Source 选为 <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>，然后在项目根目录创建 <code>.github/workflows/deploy.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Deploy</span> <span class="string">Hexo</span> <span class="string">Blog</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">on:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">push:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">branches:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">master</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">jobs:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">build:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">runs-on:</span> <span class="string">ubuntu-latest</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">steps:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Checkout</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/checkout@v4</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Setup</span> <span class="string">Node.js</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">with:</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">node-version:</span> <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Install</span> <span class="string">dependencies</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">run:</span> <span class="string">npm</span> <span class="string">install</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Build</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">run:</span> <span class="string">npx</span> <span class="string">hexo</span> <span class="string">generate</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Deploy</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v4</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">with:</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">github_token:</span> <span class="string">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class="string">secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN</span> <span class="string">&#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">publish_dir:</span> <span class="string">./public</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>之后你只需要用 Git 把源码推送到仓库：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git add .</span><br><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;update blog&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin master</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>GitHub 会自动完成构建和部署，等一两分钟就能看到更新。</p><h3 id="6-4-验证访问"><a href="#6-4-验证访问" class="headerlink" title="6.4 验证访问"></a>6.4 验证访问</h3><p>浏览器打开 <code>https://你的用户名.github.io</code>，能看到你的博客就说明部署成功了。第一次部署后 GitHub Pages 生效需要几分钟，稍等再刷新。</p><h3 id="6-5-常见部署坑"><a href="#6-5-常见部署坑" class="headerlink" title="6.5 常见部署坑"></a>6.5 常见部署坑</h3><table><thead><tr><th>现象</th><th>原因与解决</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>404 页面</td><td>仓库名必须和用户名一致；部署后等几分钟再刷新</td></tr><tr><td>改了代码线上没变化</td><td>先 <code>hexo clean</code> 再重新生成部署；检查是否推错了分支</td></tr><tr><td>部署时报权限错误</td><td>确认 <code>deploy.repo</code> 地址正确，仓库名大小写敏感</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="七、绑定自定义域名（可选）"><a href="#七、绑定自定义域名（可选）" class="headerlink" title="七、绑定自定义域名（可选）"></a>七、绑定自定义域名（可选）</h2><p>如果你不想用 <code>用户名.github.io</code> 这个默认地址，可以买一个自己的域名（阿里云、腾讯云等，几十块钱一年）。</p><ol><li><strong>添加解析</strong>：在域名服务商的控制台添加一条 CNAME 记录：</li></ol><table><thead><tr><th>记录类型</th><th>主机记录</th><th>记录值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CNAME</td><td><code>www</code> 或 <code>@</code></td><td><code>你的用户名.github.io</code></td></tr></tbody></table><ol start="2"><li><strong>添加 CNAME 文件</strong>：在 <code>source/</code> 目录下新建一个名为 <code>CNAME</code> 的文件（无扩展名），内容写你的域名：</li></ol><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">www.example.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li><strong>开启 HTTPS</strong>：在 GitHub 仓库 <strong>Settings → Pages</strong> 里勾选 Enforce HTTPS，等待证书生效即可。</li></ol>]]>
    </content>
